      "source": [
        "# Wellframe SAS → BigQuery (Colab)\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook converts the SAS job **Wellframe_GBQ.txt** into a BigQuery load executed from Google Colab.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Key points\n",
        "- Each SAS `CREATE TEMPORARY TABLE ...` is represented as a BigQuery CTE.\n",
        "- The final load is **DELETE + INSERT** (matching SAS):\n",
        "  - `DELETE FROM idd-cmsr-prod-1.CMSR.wellframe_update_final WHERE TRUE;`\n",
        "  - `INSERT INTO ... SELECT ...`\n",
        "- `beg_dt` is hardcoded to **2019-09-01** (as in SAS).\n",
        "- `end_dt` defaults to **today** at runtime (SAS used `date()`).\n",
        "- `fsn` list is taken exactly from SAS.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Important semantic carried forward from SAS\n",
        "SAS does a `LEFT OUTER JOIN` to contacts (`GT_COMBINE`) but then filters on `b.log_date BETWEEN beg_dt AND end_dt` in the `WHERE` clause, which effectively behaves like an **INNER** filter for rows with a contact in the date window. This notebook replicates that behavior exactly.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# If running in Colab, install dependencies (BigQuery client is often present, but install/upgrade to be safe)\n",
        "!pip -q install --upgrade google-cloud-bigquery google-auth pandas pyarrow"
      ]
